        "book": "Amos",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus hath the Lord God shewed unto me: and, behold, the Lord God called to contend by fire, and it devoured the great deep, and did eat up a part.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Amos 7:4",
        "book": "Amos",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Then said I, O Lord God, cease, I beseech thee: by whom shall Jacob arise? for he is small.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 82,
            "end": 84
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Amos 7:5",
        "book": "Amos",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord repented for this: This also shall not be, saith the Lord God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3,
            "text": "JST Amos 7:6 And the Lord said, concerning Jacob, Jacob shall repent of his wickedness; therefore I will not utterly destroy him, saith the Lord God."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Amos 7:6",
        "book": "Amos",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus he shewed me: and, behold, the Lord stood upon a wall made by a plumbline, with a plumbline in his hand.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 63
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Amos 7:7",
        "book": "Amos",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord said unto me, Amos, what seest thou? And I said, A plumbline. Then said the Lord, Behold, I will set a plumbline in the midst of my people Israel: I will not again pass by them any more:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 177,
            "end": 181,
            "text": "Amos 8:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
